/tools/Xilinx/Vivado/2023.1/data/xicom/cable_drivers/lin64/install_script/install_drivers/52-xilinx-ftdi-usb.rules:9:#  File Description:                                                      #
/tools/Xilinx/Vivado/2023.1/data/xicom/cable_drivers/lin64/install_script/install_drivers/52-xilinx-ftdi-usb.rules:10:#                                                                         #
/tools/Xilinx/Vivado/2023.1/data/xicom/cable_drivers/lin64/install_script/install_drivers/52-xilinx-ftdi-usb.rules:11:#  This file contains the rules used by UDEV when creating entries for    #
/tools/Xilinx/Vivado/2023.1/data/xicom/cable_drivers/lin64/install_script/install_drivers/52-xilinx-ftdi-usb.rules:12:#  Xilinx USB devices. In order for Xilinx's shared libraries and         #
/tools/Xilinx/Vivado/2023.1/data/xicom/cable_drivers/lin64/install_script/install_drivers/52-xilinx-ftdi-usb.rules:13:#  applications to access these devices without root privalages it is     #
/tools/Xilinx/Vivado/2023.1/data/xicom/cable_drivers/lin64/install_script/install_drivers/52-xilinx-ftdi-usb.rules:14:#  necessary for UDEV to create entries for which all users have read     #
/tools/Xilinx/Vivado/2023.1/data/xicom/cable_drivers/lin64/install_script/install_drivers/52-xilinx-ftdi-usb.rules:15:#  and write permission.                                                  #
/tools/Xilinx/Vivado/2023.1/data/xicom/cable_drivers/lin64/install_script/install_drivers/52-xilinx-ftdi-usb.rules:16:#                                                                         #
/tools/Xilinx/Vivado/2023.1/data/xicom/cable_drivers/lin64/install_script/install_drivers/52-xilinx-ftdi-usb.rules:17:#  Usage:                                                                 #
